<description>&lt;p&gt;Joint military operations between Ecuador and the United States are currently paused, a move the Ecuadorian government denies while the Trump administration investigates alleged human-rights abuse in Operation Hegseth. President Noboa has asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and wounded. Fugitive gang boss William Joffre Alcívar Bautista, alias Willy, was arrested in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNTHRGeEMzS3l0cG9lTGFMUDRnVzVLb1dqU1RYRlVlR29BbWFGNHI4bjNCOGJuRjhCNVFCQkQ1ZUdORTlBN1A2QVF3aUxXWERlem02SlJIYUkxOU81Q1NYVWx0MUViUFR6Qk5ETlZWUDNNU01wcFJHbVREY0JnaDlMT1RPZk11UmFNMGNVMjNKYmpEVWxEOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPaHF1QmlkZmp4LWFVNmxwMG8wTF90eVBaYmxUQWNYRzhtX2tIR21yTDhNYzBiX3VyckNjVTY5a2o0aTkzOVprb2tSc3owWWNSYlFpSEV1amFJeGo2aFk5R2ZweVlXbzZoWDVqZjM1anNBMFlaclYwUExaY3lCYzlfbEticGp3Mlh5bXZvM1hkQ1NFX3JD?oc=5&quot;&gt;Washington Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQd0JHSU9NT09WMUljWTdTVUo0OW1IYjhUX01mcFdkUmZhUklaZkRuRFlTN09PbmFaM3RMMTEyYWlIRFN3WlRxQzVfYUZKRVlDZFJsRTVibUY0M2QyRDAxN21qbkZ6MEFMcWNaOGhLYjRSd0lSR3BHVmtTbEdGd19ObFlsWkJxWFhYZTZIQ0tUVlNHTEQySVBSRGNicDZVRkVCN3Y4b3dYN0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Apa.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ1pYTExxNGw1RGRoNUJ0SzNvT0RJZGk4ZTNLZGFMZ3hkY3c2SzBSb0Z6VzRHTE5XNDdoTjlKcjNRR0F1WkNzMVhYUzRIN1ZoZ